      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEED THE METER (2) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her dominant 22.71 win at this track over 400m. Smart win two back and looks a key chance here. POURING RAIN (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.83) at Taree Super Track behind Marra Lad in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature. KENNY'S GIRL (3) looks close to another win after finishing third from Box 8 last time (17.67) at Taree Super Track. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Must be included in calculations. REBORN PASSION (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
